    <node id="双修之术">
      <data key="d0">双修之术</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">一种修炼功法，苏烟希望修炼正统双修之术以控制狐媚之体，任务长期无人接取。</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-4e684bd0f9c3b7977e1ef967541c3c6a-chunk-027</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
